      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La vez pasada, Māui le sacó el fuego a su antepasada Mahuika, y casi se quema vivo.",
          "en": "Last time, Māui tricked his ancestress Mahuika out of her fire, and was nearly burned alive."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tiempo después, Māui volvió a la aldea de sus padres.",
          "en": "Some time later, Māui came home to his parents' village."
        },
        {
          "es": "Había hecho cosas enormes: frenó al sol, pescó una isla y consiguió el fuego.",
          "en": "He had done great things. He had slowed the sun, fished up an island, and won fire from the goddess herself."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esta historia también viene de Te Rangikāheke, de Te Arawa, tal como la escribió George Grey.",
          "en": "This story also comes from Te Rangikāheke of Te Arawa, as George Grey wrote it down."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y es la última aventura de Māui.",
          "en": "And it is the last adventure of Māui."
        }
      ],
