      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Su padre, Makeatutara, le dijo: «Tu madre y otros me contaron todo lo que has hecho.»",
          "en": "His father, Makeatutara, said: 'Your mother and others have told me of all your deeds.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "«Eres muy valiente, hijo. Pero hay alguien que quizás te venza.»",
          "en": "'You are very brave, my son. But there is one who may overcome you.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "«Es tu gran antepasada, Hine-nui-te-pō.»",
          "en": "'It is your great ancestress, Hine-nui-te-pō.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "Ya la conocimos: era Hine-tītama, que bajó al mundo de abajo para esperar allí a sus hijos.",
          "en": "We met her before. She was Hine-tītama, who went down to the world below to wait there for her children."
        },
        {
          "es": "«¿Cómo es ella?», preguntó Māui.",
          "en": "'What is she like?' asked Māui."
        }
      ],
