          "en": "The old stories say she waits in the world below, and welcomes all her children at the end."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así que nadie que muere llega ante una extraña. Lo recibe su propia gran antepasada.",
          "en": "So no one who dies is met by a stranger. They are met by their own great ancestress."
